<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy Policy | MealsNMoney</title>
  <meta name="description" content="MealsNMoney Privacy Policy - Learn how we collect, use, and protect your information.">

  <!-- Favicons -->
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="48x48" href="./mealsnmoney_favicon_48x48.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="./mealsnmoney_logo_300x300.png">

  <style>
    :root {
      --teal: #00b7b7;
      --navy: #263648;
      --ink: #334155;
      --muted: #64748b;
      --border: #e2e8f0;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.7;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.04), rgba(0,0,0,.08)),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #2cc5c5 0%, #369cb2 47%, #3a5670 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    /* ---------- Top Navbar ---------- */
    .navbar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e9ec;
      padding: 12px 24px;
    }
    .nav-container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .nav-brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .nav-logo {
      height: 44px;
      width: auto;
      max-width: 240px;
      object-fit: contain;
      display: block;
    }
    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .nav-link {
      color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .nav-link:hover { color: var(--navy); }
    .nav-cta {
      background: var(--teal);
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 8px 18px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: background 0.2s ease;
    }
    .nav-cta:hover { background: #009b9b; }

    /* ---------- Policy Container Card ---------- */
    .policy-wrapper {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 50px 20px;
    }
    .policy-container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 50px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    }
    .policy-header {
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
      padding-bottom: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .policy-container h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .policy-updated {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .policy-container h2 {
      margin-top: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .policy-container h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-top: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .policy-container p {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
    .policy-container ul {
      margin-left: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .policy-container li {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .contact-card {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    /* ---------- Footer ---------- */
    .footer {
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.06), rgba(0,0,0,.12)),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #2cc5c5 0%, #369cb2 47%, #3a5670 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 32px 24px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    }
    .footer-container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .footer-copyright { margin: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); }
    .footer-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .footer-links a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.2s ease; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline; }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .policy-wrapper { padding: 30px 14px; }
      .policy-container { padding: 26px 20px; }
      .policy-container h1 { font-size: 1.7rem; }
      .nav-logo { height: 36px; }
      .footer-container { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; gap: 14px; }
      .footer-links { justify-content: center; gap: 16px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- Top Navbar -->
  <nav class="navbar">
    <div class="nav-container">
      <a href="index.html" class="nav-brand">
        <img src="./mealsnmoney_logo.png" alt="MealsNMoney Logo" class="nav-logo">
      </a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="index.html" class="nav-link">Home</a>
        <a href="index.html#download" class="nav-cta">Get App</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Main Content Card -->
  <main class="policy-wrapper">
    <div class="policy-container">
      
      <div class="policy-header">
        <h1>MealsNMoney Privacy Policy</h1>
        <div class="policy-updated">Last Updated: May 31st, 2026</div>
      </div>

      <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>This Privacy Policy explains how Thirty Seven Labs Inc. (“Company”, “we”, “us”, or “our”) collects, uses, and protects your information when you use the MealsNMoney platform, including the MealsNMoney website, mobile applications, and related services (the “Service”).</p>
      <p>By using the Service you agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.</p>

      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p><strong>Information You Provide:</strong> When you create an account or use the Service we may collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Name, email address, and authentication credentials</li>
        <li>Dietary goals, calorie preferences, and grocery budget limits</li>
        <li>Custom pantry inventory items, grocery lists, and saved recipes</li>
        <li>Communications sent through support channels</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>2.1. Activity and Usage Information</h3>
      <p>We may collect information about how you interact with the Service, such as generated meal plans, recipes viewed, features used, and application session duration.</p>

      <h3>2.2. Device & Technical Information</h3>
      <p>We may automatically collect device identifiers, operating system version, browser type, and diagnostic logs to ensure application stability.</p>
	  
	  <h3>2.3. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h3>
      <p>We may use cookies and similar technologies to remember user preferences, improve functionality, analyze usage patterns, and enhance security.</p>

      <h3>2.4. Payment Information</h3>
      <p>Paid memberships and subscriptions may be processed through third-party payment providers depending on platform:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>On Android devices, payments may be processed through Google Play Billing.</li>
        <li>On iOS devices, payments may be processed through Apple in-app purchase systems.</li>
        <li>On web platforms, payments may be processed through providers such as Stripe.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not store full payment card information on our servers.</p>

      <h2>3. How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>We use collected data to build personalized meal recommendations, optimize ingredient shopping lists, manage user accounts, and maintain platform security. We do not sell user personal data.</p>

      <h2>4. Sharing of Information</h2>
      <p>We may share information with authentication providers, service providers supporting the platform, payment processors, analytics providers, and legal authorities when required by law.</p>
      <p>We use third-party service providers to help operate the Service (cloud hosting, authentication, analytics, notifications, storage, and AI processing). <strong>We do not sell user personal data.</strong></p>
	  
	  <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We implement reasonable security measures including encrypted connections (TLS), access controls, monitoring, logging, and regular backups. However, no system can guarantee absolute security.</p>

      <h2>6. User Rights</h2>
      <p>Users may update profile information, control communication preferences, and request account deletion. Depending on your location, additional rights may apply under local privacy laws including rights to access, correct, delete, or restrict processing of personal information.</p>

      <h2>7. Age Requirement</h2>
      <p>The Service is not intended for individuals under 18 years of age. We do not knowingly collect personal information from minors.</p>

      <h2>8. International Data Transfers</h2>
      <p>Information may be processed in the United States and other countries where our service providers operate.</p>

      <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Material changes may be communicated through the Service.</p>

      <h2>10. Data Retention & Account Deletion</h2>
      <p>We retain personal information only as long as necessary to provide the Service. You can delete your account and associated meal plans anytime directly within the app settings or by contacting <a href="mailto:support@mealsnmoney.com" style="color: var(--teal);">support@mealsnmoney.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>11. Contact Information</h2>
      <div class="contact-card">
        <strong>Thirty Seven Labs Inc.</strong><br>
        1111B S Governors Ave STE 81485<br>
        Dover, DE 19904<br>
        United States<br><br>
        Email: <a href="mailto:support@mealsnmoney.com" style="color: var(--teal); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">support@mealsnmoney.com</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-container">
      <p class="footer-copyright">&copy; 2026 Thirty Seven Labs Inc. All rights reserved.</p>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="termsofservice.html">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="privacypolicy.html">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="mailto:support@mealsnmoney.com">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>